<head>
<no>3</no><heading id="sec.3-he"
guid="_61bdb070-51d7-477c-902f-9dcc18e004ca"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.1"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_18c5bc0e-a8d2-403b-9e77-5e9af6e3ad56"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm id="sec.3-def.derivativearrangement"
guid="_f89a827a-7bc1-4edb-b0c8-597dd5bcaa36"
type="definition"><b><i>derivative arrangement</i></b></defterm> has the same
meaning as in the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act" refid="act-2018-055"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Government Sector Finance Act
2018</i></name></legref>.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm id="sec.3-def.governmentagency"
guid="_10afd8d9-ef96-4b87-9276-a41b27e507b0"
type="definition"><b><i>government agency</i></b></defterm> means any of the
following:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.a" guid="_9f8c3cce-7e7f-4514-b2f1-0e46f8d122c2"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a government sector agency (within the meaning of
the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act" refid="act-2013-040" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Government Sector Employment Act
2013</i></name></legref>),</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.b" guid="_27d77c8b-85c1-48a5-ab63-c08d2443a98c"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a NSW government agency or other public authority
constituted by or under an Act,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.c" guid="_1a85e94f-b699-45df-9863-b6cd33e250fb"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a local council or other local
authority,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.d" guid="_1bfbb9e8-f27c-46bd-9797-af1cebeef73c"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a State owned
corporation.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm id="sec.3-def.theFund"
guid="_6a993485-bfcf-4d04-8b7d-d53131635ef3" type="definition"><b><i>the
Fund</i></b></defterm> means the Social and Affordable Housing NSW Fund
established under this Act.</txt></block></deflist>
</block>
<note id="sec.3-ssec.1-note" guid="_435aa788-346f-4295-9447-41f26d6c1b2e"
type="legtext"><heading id="sec.3-ssec.1-note-he"
guid="_a5ffa83d-845c-47cd-acce-5306584c1f1c"><b>Note&#8212;</b></heading>
<block><txt break.before="1">The <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
refid="act-1987-015" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Interpretation
Act 1987</i></name></legref> contains definitions and other provisions that
affect the interpretation and application of this Act.</txt></block></note>
</tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.2"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_aab59e6e-7d8a-40ed-a4d9-8f07b8e2311e"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Notes included in this Act do not form part of
this Act.</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 3:</b> Am 2017 No 22,
Sch 2.36; 2018 No 70, Sch 3.54 [1].</txt></content>
</level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.2"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_45b2053e-6551-4dac-9375-a3260f240257"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 2</b></no><heading id="pt.2-he"
guid="_f7ec5e6d-7c2f-40c8-9db1-016e27a7163e"><b>Social and Affordable Housing
NSW Fund</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d87116be-38d0-4750-9cd0-119629439c29"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading id="sec.4-he"
guid="_de6b6821-2bf6-4bd0-a9a0-bd935dd26914"><b>Establishment of the
Fund</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">There is to be established in the Special
Deposits Account the Social and Affordable Housing NSW
Fund.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_811f7cf8-a30f-4231-9ecb-e7ea895c64ec"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading id="sec.5-he"
guid="_afcfa5ac-e234-4083-bc84-97c6b338f2a9"><b>Purpose of the
Fund</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The purpose of the Fund is to provide funding to
promote any of the objects of the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
refid="act-2001-052" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Housing Act
2001</i></name></legref> or the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
refid="act-2012-059" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Community Housing
Providers (Adoption of National Law) Act
2012</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9ca5440b-70b8-4db2-b0e9-6b90418772a1"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading id="sec.6-he"
guid="_e00a72d6-9885-4d7d-9d5b-e11cc7fa5965"><b>Control and management of
Fund</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister is to control and manage the
Fund.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d259bc6a-e2e4-4ade-b09a-74082414014d"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading id="sec.7-he"
guid="_5c1495db-789a-4e3d-8a43-bc939caeecc7"><b>Payment into the
Fund</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.1"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d558ffcc-849a-4f42-b585-64eb44e78585"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The following are to be paid into the
Fund:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.a" guid="_ccdce44f-2846-45d8-b00b-0cb2bedad269"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">all money appropriated by Parliament, or advanced
by the Treasurer, for payment into the Fund,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.b" guid="_2a9c50ef-553d-417d-83a9-de1ed54e3efb"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">all money appropriated by Parliament to the
Treasurer for the general purposes of the Government (and not for the purposes
of individual government agencies) and directed by the Treasurer to be paid
into the Fund,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.c" guid="_e926768d-f0cb-401e-8336-2d5b02108282"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the proceeds of the investment of money in the
Fund,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.d" guid="_fc6440bf-6c86-4990-9cbf-bfca15654719"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any money borrowed by the Minister for the
purpose of the Fund,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.e" guid="_64a93c3c-841c-42a7-aeca-5fdddb0ebc74"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any grant, gift, bequest or other contribution of
money to the Fund made by a government agency or other person or
body,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.f" guid="_b0aec0d8-8662-41c2-a1b8-0c0cf7b696c8"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(f)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the payment or repayment of principal or interest
on money loaned from the Fund (including fees associated with the
loan),</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.g" guid="_8cc9db84-6b13-4dcc-8452-9fb8b6b94124"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(g)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any money payable arising from a derivative
arrangement (or other financial risk management strategy) effected by the
Minister for the purpose of the Fund,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.7-ssec.1-para1.h" guid="_aceff58c-7e46-49ab-a494-a769733a9b89"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(h)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">all other money directed or authorised to be paid
into the Fund by or under any Act or law.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.2"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e98a4e20-1178-4b8e-8030-a6868f32dc44"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Government agencies are authorised by this
section to make contributions to the Fund.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.3"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_68dcffad-23b7-47fc-aeb7-c5d1582c3755"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Treasurer may direct that any money directed
to be paid into the Fund by the Treasurer is subject to the repayment of the
money (including an amount in the nature of interest) from the
Fund.</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 7:</b> Am 2018 No 70,
Sch 3.54 [2].</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_038ed515-9f9a-4665-8a25-e3bf1a663d51"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading id="sec.8-he"
guid="_42af70b6-767e-4c82-9a7b-5326987614da"><b>Payments out of the
Fund</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.1"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f37a4825-43b3-4eb8-b653-c3f163696a01"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The following may be paid out of the Fund:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li id="sec.8-ssec.1-para1.a" guid="_0f312d69-b63c-427e-8d93-75847bae3e5a"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">all or any part of the cost of any project,
program or initiative that the Minister is satisfied promotes the purpose of
the Fund,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.8-ssec.1-para1.b" guid="_ea68a889-700e-41c5-9fdf-9ecfcdcb0885"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">administrative expenses relating to the control
and management of the Fund,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.8-ssec.1-para1.c" guid="_f5c5711e-de87-46ae-8a9a-1df012f41852"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the payment or repayment of principal or interest
on money borrowed by the Minister for the purpose of the Fund (including any
costs associated with the borrowing),</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.8-ssec.1-para1.d" guid="_9a7fac60-a26d-465b-876a-133cf50f142c"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any payment or repayment of money from the Fund
referred to in section 7 (3),</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.8-ssec.1-para1.e" guid="_baa61250-b67d-4d01-99ae-1d420c265aa7"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any money payable arising from a derivative
arrangement (or other financial risk management strategy) effected by the
Minister for the purpose of the Fund,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.8-ssec.1-para1.f" guid="_ea93fcf2-ffb4-4952-9d6c-dcf8b071e138"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(f)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any money directed or authorised to be paid from
the Fund by or under this Act or any other Act or
law.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.2"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2c0c22d7-9748-4b7b-9b98-dfb846f0689a"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Payments from the Fund for the cost of a project,
program or initiative may be provided by way of a grant, subsidy, loan or
other financial assistance and may be subject to such conditions as the
Minister thinks fit.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.3"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_af129dcf-6c15-455f-983a-216ad2a735f1"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Without limiting subsection (2), those conditions
may relate to the following:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li id="sec.8-ssec.3-para1.a" guid="_e870bd7c-ae88-4fd3-9d98-7d90480928a7"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">meeting specified performance targets or
outcomes,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.8-ssec.3-para1.b" guid="_044f33c9-2d45-4e4b-b9da-d84fd39e8de7"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">repayment of the whole or any part of any such
financial assistance (including repayment if specified performance targets or
outcomes are not met as required under a condition of the provision of the
financial assistance),</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.8-ssec.3-para1.c" guid="_a5e7306a-d792-4b24-8abd-a78f95efbef8"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the payment of interest on financial assistance
provided by way of a loan,</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.8-ssec.3-para1.d" guid="_6898ca4f-204a-410b-a5b0-500987ed8159"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the periods or intervals at which repayments are
to be made.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 8:</b> Am 2018 No 70,
Sch 3.54 [3].</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b3fe2fa8-58dd-4971-99ec-4d8e70ec2b45"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading id="sec.9-he"
guid="_1270a993-561a-446d-951d-5dcacec10d8a"><b>Investment of money in the
Fund</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister may invest money in the Fund:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li id="sec.9-para1.a" guid="_5ea89b4d-b11a-48f2-ba39-1f57068ff17d"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">if the Minister is a GSF agency for the purposes
of Part 6 of the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act" refid="act-2018-055"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Government Sector Finance Act
2018</i></name></legref>&#8212;in any way that the Minister is permitted to
invest money under that Part, or</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.9-para1.b" guid="_d24cd9d1-ed1f-4448-b31d-71ca1a4aa56a"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">if the Minister is not a GSF agency for the
purposes of Part 6 of the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act" refid="act-2018-055"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Government Sector Finance Act
2018</i></name></legref>&#8212;in any way approved by the
Treasurer.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 9:</b> Subst 2018 No
70, Sch 3.54 [4].</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.10">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_16fcec64-bfca-4501-93e2-34077b54f20f"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>10</no><heading id="sec.10-he"
guid="_19bb1aab-6cd3-4d0f-a3f0-e8f0882049ef"><b>Borrowings and derivative
arrangements</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister may for the purposes of the Fund
borrow or enter into derivative arrangements:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li id="sec.10-para1.a" guid="_43ac1d93-7a5a-44fa-9b26-8e61fbb82278"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">if the Minister is a GSF agency for the purposes
of Part 6 of the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act" refid="act-2018-055"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Government Sector Finance Act
2018</i></name></legref>&#8212;in any way that the Minister is permitted to
borrow or enter into derivative arrangements under that Part,
or</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.10-para1.b" guid="_e8a37111-4cbe-4966-b8ba-6af656fc3c1e"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">if the Minister is not a GSF agency for the
purposes of Part 6 of the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act" refid="act-2018-055"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Government Sector Finance Act
2018</i></name></legref>&#8212;in any way approved by the
Treasurer.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 10:</b> Subst 2018 No
70, Sch 3.54 [5].</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.11">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_66d8839b-cc59-442f-bc55-849f118ce8f7"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>11</no><heading id="sec.11-he"
guid="_2146f012-3030-40e5-980f-6204278db8d8"><b>Minister may obtain advice
etc</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister may, in exercising functions under
this Act, obtain and have regard to any advice, recommendations or other
information provided to the Minister by any person or body that the Minister
considers relevant.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.12">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.12"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_dfb32e7b-14ed-4f0d-9896-490725d649dc"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>12</no><heading id="sec.12-he"
guid="_4da39b55-bf7d-4cee-9a94-6b1419ffb6c1"><b>Annual and other reports
relating to the Fund</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.12-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.12-ssec.1"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1ccf4c6b-5328-499b-b248-5b21f471df0e"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister is to produce an annual report
detailing payments from the Fund.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.12-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.12-ssec.2"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6e5d4026-d7d0-49d3-899a-fe3770f5dc7f"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The annual report is to include an audit of the
Fund by the Auditor-General (including a report of the Auditor-General on
whether the payments from the Fund have been made in accordance with this
Act).</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.12-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.12-ssec.3"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b6f0c69d-a4f4-4c61-80bd-12f48319d614"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The annual report is to be made publicly
available within 6 months after the end of the financial year to which it
relates.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.3"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_eec984ee-4007-494a-92e5-8846cb107ccb"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 3</b></no><heading id="pt.3-he"
guid="_659e3711-229d-4c8f-a247-f60de83dfce9"><b>Miscellaneous</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.13">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8828065b-f769-4be5-bf6d-6c5bc8eb9861"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>13</no><heading id="sec.13-he"
guid="_741dcd6c-adcc-4591-93ff-01cbb3d0c1b2"><b>Delegation</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister may delegate the exercise of any
function of the Minister under this Act (other than this power of delegation)
to:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li id="sec.13-para1.a" guid="_0bee1457-14c1-4c90-a439-0534e256ea12"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the Secretary of the Treasury or any person
employed in the Treasury, or</txt></block></li>
<li id="sec.13-para1.b" guid="_e3cc8b75-eebe-4f9e-a15f-2a46040630fe"
provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any other person employed in a Public Service
agency prescribed by the regulations.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.14">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.14"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_beaa8015-1548-43fd-a31e-15988f81b96b"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>14</no><heading id="sec.14-he"
guid="_806d8345-7c41-4bab-b696-1c5c0f05e659"><b>Act to bind
Crown</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act binds the Crown in right of New South
Wales and, in so far as the legislative power of the Parliament of New South
Wales permits, the Crown in all its other capacities.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.15">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.15"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_66534990-9ee6-46b8-9053-0fe881ebd8e9"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>15</no><heading id="sec.15-he"
guid="_dbd8553e-6e09-4141-b6ee-ab8590fb8b10"><b>Regulations</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.15-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.15-ssec.1"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_92b1efd4-2263-492e-af27-62fd214623ba"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may make regulations, not
inconsistent with this Act, for or with respect to any matter that by this Act
is required or permitted to be prescribed or that is necessary or convenient
to be prescribed for carrying out or giving effect to this
Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.15-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.15-ssec.2"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6841995b-f2b0-4ce4-b93e-a87c13215327"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The regulations may contain provisions of a
savings or transitional nature.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.16">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.16"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_713d77ad-ec6a-4c67-a34d-986fad241624"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>16</no><heading id="sec.16-he"
guid="_fcce90fe-f699-4bf2-ae8c-b97bf489a047"><b>Review of
Act</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.16-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.16-ssec.1"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ebefdb84-d8cb-4310-ba9e-2cd89f0110de"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister is to review this Act to determine
whether the policy objectives of the Act remain valid and whether the terms of
the Act remain appropriate for securing those
objectives.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.16-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.16-ssec.2"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_daa175ba-3b3b-4286-85b7-5c5a345a860d"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The review is to be undertaken as soon as
possible after the period of 5 years from the commencement of this
Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.16-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.16-ssec.3"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3e117d2e-f439-42f4-8d26-78bafe32cdcd"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A report on the outcome of the review is to be
tabled in each House of Parliament within 12 months after the end of that
period of 5 years.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</level>
</content>


